# ==========================================
# Sensitive docs — filenames that should never appear
# ==========================================
# THREAT_MODEL.md + docs/runbooks/ are intentionally tracked (public
# architecture + operations references, scrubbed of creds). The single
# entry left here is the historical SECRETS.md filename — a red flag
# that must never appear in the repo. Actual secrets go into the
# secrets management system, documented in docs/security/secret-management.md.
docs/SECRETS.md

