**/.pgpass
**/pgpass
**/.mysql_history
**/.psql_history
**/dump.rdb
**/appendonly.aof
**/*.mongorc.js
**/.dbeaver-data-sources.xml

# --- Token / session files sometimes dropped in repo ---
**/vault-token
**/.vault-token
**/*.vault
**/session_*.json
!**/session_*.example.json
**/tokens_*.json
!**/tokens_*.example.json
**/cookies.txt
**/cookiejar
**/.netrc
**/_netrc

# --- Package registry auth ---
**/.docker/config.json
**/.cargo/credentials
**/.cargo/credentials.toml

# --- Shell history that occasionally captures secrets ---
**/.bash_history
**/.zsh_history
**/.python_history
**/.node_repl_history
**/.irb_history

# --- Common misc leak sinks ---
**/*.leaked
**/*.exposed
**/secret_backup*
**/backup_secrets*

# ==========================================
# Broader defensive patterns v2 (2026-07-26)
# ==========================================
# The categories below were added after a repo-wide sweep identified
# common credential-carrying files not covered by earlier patterns.

# --- AI CLI + agent framework config directories ---
# Modern LLM CLIs cache API keys in their own dot-directories.
**/.anthropic/
**/.openai/
**/.copilot/
**/.cursor/
**/.gemini/
**/.aider/
**/.perplexity/
# Note: .claude/ is already listed under IDEs/Editors above.

# --- Editor / autosave / merge cruft that may contain plaintext creds ---
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*~
**/.#*
**/#*#

# --- Network-capture dumps (often contain plaintext bearer tokens) ---
**/*.pcap
**/*.pcapng
**/*.chls
**/*.saz
**/*.har

# --- API-testing tools whose exports include bearer tokens ---
**/*postman_collection*.json
**/postman_environment*.json
**/insomnia*.json
**/insomnia_export*.json
**/thunder-collection*.json
**/.rest-client.env.json
**/http-client.private.env.json

# --- direnv / dotenv-style extras ---
**/.envrc
**/.envrc.local
**/.env.direnv

# --- Kubernetes credentials beyond the standard kubeconfig ---
**/kubeadm-config*.yaml
**/kubeadm-init*.yaml
**/*bootstrap-token*
**/*serviceaccount-token*

# --- Ansible vault + related ---
**/.vault_pass
**/.vault_pass.txt
**/vault_pass*.txt
**/.ansible/tmp/
**/ansible.log

# --- HashiCorp additional ---
**/.consul-token
**/.nomad-token
**/.terraformrc
**/vault-agent.hcl

# --- Yarn / pnpm auth files ---
**/.yarnrc.yml
!**/.yarnrc.example.yml
**/.pnpmfile.cjs.local
**/npm-shrinkwrap.local.json

# --- Docker Compose local overrides (frequently carry laptop secrets) ---
**/docker-compose.override.yml
**/docker-compose.override.yaml
**/docker-compose.local.yml
**/docker-compose.dev.yml
!**/docker-compose.override.example.yml
# The project's own docker-compose.aws.yml + docker-compose.prod.yml
# + docker-compose.test.yml + docker-compose.uioverride.yml are all
# TRACKED intentionally — they don't ship secrets, only config.

# --- Frontend framework env variants ---
**/vite.config.local.*
**/next.config.local.*
**/nuxt.config.local.*
**/svelte.config.local.*
**/astro.config.local.*
**/.env.vite.local
**/.env.next.local

# --- Session + JWT dumps ---
**/*.jwt
**/*.session
**/*.bearer
**/token.txt
**/*_token.txt

# --- Local scratch under repo root (safety net) ---
/scratch_*
/private_*
/local_*
**/PERSONAL_NOTES.md

# --- CI runner secrets stashed locally ---
**/.github/workflows/local/
**/.circleci/local/
**/act.env
**/act.secrets

# --- Terraform Cloud lock + Terragrunt cache ---
**/terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/.terragrunt-cache/

# --- Local Redis / Postgres data leaks ---
**/redis.conf.local
**/postgresql.conf.local
**/pg_hba.local

# --- Chart-generation output + test artifacts that may hold employee-key echoes ---
docs/testing/**/chart-data*.json
docs/testing/**/creds*.txt
docs/testing/**/mint*.txt
docs/testing/**/*.env

# --- Common one-off creds landing in the repo root ---
/anthropic_key
/openai_key
/aegis_token
/claude_key
/*.token
/*.secret
!/tsconfig*.json
!/pyproject.toml
!/package.json

# --- Log dumps that may echo bearer headers ---
**/access.log
**/nginx-access.log
**/uvicorn-*.log
**/gunicorn-*.log
**/access_log*
**/error_log*
